OL,3,GNEWSARiver water quality tracked by new
OL,4,Asensors
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has launched a water quality
OL,7,Fmonitoring project which aims to give
OL,8,Fpeople reliable information about the
OL,9,Fhealth of rivers.
OL,11,FThis project was announced at an event
OL,12,Fin Salcombe, Devon, where a plaque was
OL,13,Funveiled to showcase one of the new
OL,14,Fmonitoring stations at Normandy
OL,15,FPontoon.
OL,17,FSouth Hams District Council said it
OL,18,Fwanted to make water quality
OL,19,Finformation easier to access and
OL,20,Funderstand.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
