OL,3,GNEWSARiver water quality tracked by new
OL,4,Asensors
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor John McKay, the council's
OL,7,Fexecutive member for climate change and
OL,8,Fbiodiversity, said: "This is a
OL,9,Fbrilliant example of what can happen
OL,10,Fwhen communities, researchers and
OL,11,Fbusinesses come together to tackle a
OL,12,Freal issue."
